# worktree-attributes - local attribute overrides for a clone of this repository.
# Upstream marks these files 'text eol=crlf' and ALSO stores them with CRLF, so git
# status reports them modified forever although the bytes on disk equal the blob
# (verified: hash-object --no-filters == index sha). A root .gitattributes cannot
# win over upstream's nearer one; .git/info/attributes can, but is not cloned.
# After a fresh clone:   cat tools/worktree-attributes >> .git/info/attributes
# Regenerate the list only from a byte-identical worktree (tools/ingest-tree).
